#. <CLT 4>大神さんに例の件を確認するのは、
#. 明日に持ち越しか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'll have to wait till tomorrow to confront Sakura\n"
"about what I saw.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…ちょっとホッとしてるかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But in a way...I'm kinda relieved.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>面と向かって大神さんに問い詰めるのは、
#. 勇気がいるしな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It takes a lot of courage to stand face-to-face with\n"
"Sakura and accuse her of something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ、時間はあるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have plenty of time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じっとしている気分じゃない。
#. どこかに行ってみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't feel like just sitting here. I should go\n"
"somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have some time, so maybe I should take a little\n"
"rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
